Z||000001||Alex2004||12-13-2001||10:17 PM||||Have you taken the black cover off yet, it has 5 T15 srews 3 on top 2 on the back part and i think 2 7mm somewhere but mine have been broke.  If you've taken that off just look over your steering wheel and the speedo should be the 2 bulbs around then speedo.  Just kinda take a guess.  but one of them is the closest to the edge of the panel.  when your looking at your bulbs i'd just take everyone out and look.  And take a bulb you know that works and plug it into the speedo light and then turn parking lights on and see if it lights up.  It's not that hard. you just have to look.  Hope that helps some!<P>Alex...  Ps tried to make 2 diagrams for you but niether worked... sorry..<BR><p>[This message has been edited by Alex2004 (edited 12-13-2001).]||||reg||5
